%N A055553 Number of Carmichael numbers (A002997) less than 10^n.
%C A055553 Of the 774716397 Carmichael numbers below 10^25, 139763 have 13 prime factors, 1599 have 14 and 2 have 15; none has more. For 3 to 12 prime factors see A132195, A174612-A174617, A299710, A299711 and A392847. - _Jeff Sponaugle_, Nov 23 2026
